**Not taken:** the critic suggested showing a runner-up flight in the Best, Cheapest and Fastest tabs when one flight wins more than one. That made the Best tab name a different flight from the card tagged Best, so I put it back: each tab shows its own winner, even when two tabs show the same flight.

